<title>THAILAND: Siam City Cement sets up Singapore unit.</title>
<headline>Siam City Cement sets up Singapore unit.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Siam City Cement Plc said on Friday it would set up a holding company in Singapore to oversee its investments abroad.</p>
<p>The Siam City Cement (Singapore) Pte would have initital capital of S$100,000, wholly held by Siam City Cement, the company said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>Siam City Cement's unit in Singapore would invest in industrial, agricultural, commercial, mining and transportation businesses in and outside Singapore, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
